    "Status": "POC_ONLY"
  },
  {
    "ID": "level1:3404:m_text",
    "Context": "TextMeshPro",
    "Source": "Adjust your monitor or telvesion's settings until the Mt. Holly symbol above is just barely visible and the images in the corners are not.\n\nPress [ENTER] whem you are satisfied.",
